usage: wc [options] file [more...]
count the words in files

  -v, --verbose  print each file's count
  -q, --quiet    print nothing
  -m, --min MIN  skip words shorter than this (default 1)
      --out OUT  write here
  file           the file to read
  more...        other files
  -h, --help     show this help
own: file=in.txt v=true
